        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 461232, Two Piece Entry Door Handleset with Normandy Grip</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Wrought Steel Two Piece Normandy Handleset has an old world feel thanks to the rustic material from which it is made. It is available in satin steel and flack black steel finishes. Emtek's Two Piece Entry Door Handleset with Normandy Grip will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-5/8 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. Choose from a wide array of historic interior trim knobs and levers. The Normandy Wrought Steel Tubular Handleset is available in either a single cylinder or a dummy cylinder function. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Normandy Wrought Steel Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Two Piece Entrance Handleset with Normandy Grip:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Steel</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Height: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Mount Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-460232-specifications.pdf?v=1704262357\"><b>Emtek 461232 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Wrought-Steel-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Wrought Steel Two Piece Normandy Handleset",
